  "title": "Westamerica Bancorporation Declares Quarterly Cash Dividend",
  "summary": "San Rafael, CA: The Board of Directors of Westamerica Bancorporation (NASDAQ: WABC) today declared a quarterly cash dividend of $0.48 per share on common stock outstanding to shareholders of record at the close of business August 3, 2026. The dividend is payable August 14, 2026. Chairman, President and CEO David Payne stated, “This quarterly dividend recognizes […] The post Westamerica Bancorporation Declares Quarterly Cash Dividend first appeared on Westamerica Bank .",
